00:58:07.300 --> 00:58:14.410
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who has this response to every show: "My god, this is so boring!"

00:58:14.410 --> 00:58:18.190
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with my stories of This American Life.

00:58:18.190 --> 00:58:55.730
<v Father - Adrian Leblank>"I'm still bowling on Fridays with the senior citizens."

00:58:55.730 --> 00:59:00.730
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International.
